---
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";
---
<div id="agents" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-section);">
  <div data-r="split" style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 40px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 400px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 72px;">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
      <div style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--ink-4);">04 &nbsp;·&nbsp; CONFIGURATION</div>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 400; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.7vw, 46px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Agents are<br>configured, not<br>prompted.</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-3); text-wrap: pretty;">Each agent has a role, a model, a set of repositories, a runtime image, and an explicit permission list. Change the model and every future run uses it. Revoke a permission and the runtime refuses the call.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 6px;">
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3);">Agents are workspace members. They appear in mentions, filters, and analytics.</div>
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3);">Instructions are versioned. Every run records which revision it used.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div role="img" aria-label="The configuration for an agent named Forge: its model, the repositories it can read, an explicit permission list with merge-without-approval switched off, its runtime environment, and its versioned instructions." style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-2);">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">
        <Logo size={24} />
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;">
          <span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink);">forge</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-4);">Primary coding agent · updated 2 days ago</span>
        </div>
        <span style="margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--run);"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--run); border-radius: 50%;"></span>Busy</span>
      </div>
      <div data-r="split" data-hairline style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; background: var(--line);">
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <div style="font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--ink-4);">MODEL</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);">claude‑sonnet‑5</div>
          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-4);">197K context · $2 in / $10 out per M · tools</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <div style="font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--ink-4);">REPOSITORY ACCESS</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);">berry/frontend</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);">berry/api</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px;">
          <div style="font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--ink-4);">PERMISSIONS</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);"><span style="color: var(--done);">✓</span>Read repository</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);"><span style="color: var(--done);">✓</span>Create branches</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);"><span style="color: var(--done);">✓</span>Run commands</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2);"><span style="color: var(--done);">✓</span>Open pull requests</div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-4);"><span style="color: var(--ink-4);">○</span>Merge without approval</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 18px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px;">
          <div style="font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--ink-4);">ENVIRONMENT</div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;">
            <span style="border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3);">node 24</span>
            <span style="border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3);">pnpm</span>
            <span style="border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3);">docker</span>
            <span style="border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3);">playwright</span>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-4); margin-top: 2px;">Workspace is destroyed when the run ends.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 16px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-4);">
        <span style="color: var(--ink-3);">Instructions · rev 12</span> &nbsp; You are Forge, the primary coding agent for the Berry workspace. Prefer the smallest correct change. Never modify migrations without an issue reference.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
